# Synthesis output is large and machine-specific: the funcsim netlist alone was
# 43 MB on the first run, and the utilization report has a row per PE. Keep it all
# out of the repo...
out/*

# ...EXCEPT the compact summary. That file is under a page and exists precisely so
# a run's result can be shared without copying a console, so it must be committable.
# Note this needs `out/*` above rather than `out/`: a trailing-slash directory
# pattern stops git descending into the directory at all, and a negation inside it
# would then never be reached.
!out/step0_summary.txt

*.jou
*.log
*.v
